        "description": "Final approach targeting for the Ares Vallis EDL site."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 212,
        "type": "arrival",
        "label": "Mars approach + cruise-stage separation",
        "description": "1997-07-04 — Independence Day. Cruise stage separated; the backshell entered Mars's atmosphere at 7.3 km/s."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 212.005,
        "type": "edl_or_oi",
        "label": "Mars EDL — airbag landing in Ares Vallis",
        "description": "First-ever airbag landing on Mars. After parachute + retrorockets, the airbag-cocooned lander bounced 15+ times across the Ares Vallis floodplain before rolling to a stop. Sojourner deployed via the lander's solar-panel ramps and roamed for 83 sols, returning the first wheeled mobility data from another planet. Communications lost 1997-09-27 due to battery failure."
      }
